 - **Durable run-start projection:** `AgentRunCoordinator::start_revalidated_run_start` accepts only a product-revalidated `RunStartRecordV1` and projects the canonical durable tuple into the sole daemon coordinator: `admitted_source_digest` is the runtime request identity; runtime body, artifact set, authority epoch, generation, fence and deadline are exact durable fields. `ExplicitAbstain` never enters runtime admission. The bridge deliberately does not authenticate a raw retained journal record; current AuthBus/trust revalidation is a mandatory caller precondition.
